    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desktop Trains is a cozy pixel-art railway simulator where you build railroads, manage trains, and collect rare locomotives with unique designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude82 Manage Your Railway</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send trains from one point to another across a detailed pixel map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan routes and watch your trains move in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee4\ufe0f Buy and Customize Trains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase new locomotives and wagons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your train sets to suit different tasks and missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Build and Expand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct and upgrade stations to unlock new routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your infrastructure to handle growing traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf08 Unlock Rare Trains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect unique trains with bright and unusual paint jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete challenges to unlock special models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 Transport Cargo and Passengers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn money by delivering goods and passengers between stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desktop Trains is a cozy pixel-art railway simulator where you build railroads, manage trains, and collect rare locomotives with unique designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude82 Manage Your Railway</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send trains from one point to another across a detailed pixel map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan routes and watch your trains move in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee4\ufe0f Buy and Customize Trains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase new locomotives and wagons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your train sets to suit different tasks and missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Build and Expand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct and upgrade stations to unlock new routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your infrastructure to handle growing traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf08 Unlock Rare Trains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect unique trains with bright and unusual paint jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete challenges to unlock special models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 Transport Cargo and Passengers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn money by delivering goods and passengers between stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
